## 5. API ENHANCEMENTS

### Added Missing Rate Calculations:

**Library Report (report.service.ts):**
```typescript
circulationRate: Math.round((totalIssued / totalBooks) * 100)
```

**ECA Report (report.service.ts):**
```typescript
participationRate: Math.round((totalParticipants / totalStudents) * 100)
```

### Updated Type Definitions (report.types.ts):
```typescript
interface LibraryReport {
  // ... existing fields
  circulationRate?: number;  // Added
}

interface ECAReport {
  // ... existing fields
  participationRate?: number;  // Added
}
```

---

## 6. DASHBOARD DATA TRANSFORMATION

### Fixed ECA Activity Distribution:
**Before:** Looking for non-existent `activityDistribution`
**After:** Transform `byCategory` data from API:
```typescript
const activityDistribution = useMemo(() => {
  if (!reportData?.eca?.byCategory) return [];
  return reportData.eca.byCategory.map((item: any) => ({
    subject: item.category,
    A: item.count,
  }));
}, [reportData?.eca]);
```

